          "snippet": {
            "text": "theorem circle_identity (X N : ℕ) (a b c : ℕ → ℂ) :\n    ∫ α in (0:ℝ)..1, expSum X a α * expSum X b α * expSum X c α * e (-(N * α)) =\n      ∑ n₁ ∈ range (X + 1), ∑ n₂ ∈ range (X + 1), ∑ n₃ ∈ range (X + 1),\n        if n₁ + n₂ + n₃ = N then a n₁ * b n₂ * c n₃ else 0 :=",
